                               https://mfem.org

This directory contains modifications of the example codes that illustrate the
use of MFEM's ODE checkpointing classes (mfem::ODECheckpointer and its storage
layouts, see linalg/ode_checkpoint.hpp) together with mfem::CheckpointController
(see linalg/checkpoint.hpp).

Each example keeps the forward time loop of the original example and adds
checkpointing in blocks marked ">>> Checkpointing" and "<<< Checkpointing".
After the forward loop, a reverse sweep revisits every state in reverse order,
as an adjoint computation would, restoring checkpoints and replaying steps.

No additional build options are required.

We recommend comparing the original example codes with the corresponding files
in the current directory.

See also the checkpointing miniapps in ../../miniapps/checkpointing.
